2. The Software

Logcat On connects to Android devices and emulators through the Android Debug Bridge ("adb") to display logs and can perform actions that affect devices and apps, such as installing, launching, force-stopping, and uninstalling apps. All such actions are initiated by you; the Software performs them at your direction.

